#. module: database_size_report
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:database_size_report.database_size_report_view_form
msgid ""
"Sizes come straight from PostgreSQL: <strong>Table Size</strong> is the\n"
"                        table itself (including its TOAST overflow storage), <strong>Index\n"
"                        Size</strong> is all of its indexes, and <strong>Total Size</strong>\n"
"                        is what the table really costs on disk. <strong>Rows</strong> is\n"
"                        PostgreSQL's own estimate, not an exact count, so the report is\n"
"                        instant even on a very large database.\n"
"                        <strong>Database on Disk</strong> is bigger than the total of the\n"
"                        tables because it also holds the PostgreSQL catalogs and the free\n"
"                        space left behind by deleted rows.\n"
"                        This report only reads: none of your records is changed or deleted.\n"
"                        The report itself is a temporary record that Odoo cleans up on its own."
msgstr ""

